    1. Create 9x9 BLACK grid
    2. Pick bar_count in [4, 5]
    3. Pick start_col parity (0 or 1); place bars at columns start_col, start_col+2, ...
       ensuring all fit within grid width (max col <= 8)
    4. Generate bar_count distinct heights from [1..9] (sample without replacement)
    5. For each bar, fill column from (9 - height) to row 8 with GREY
    6. Verify unique tallest and shortest (guaranteed by distinct heights)
```
